6. Assumptions, Validation, and Change Control
This document defines planned scope, not completed app functionality. The project uses a seven-month planning horizon, which remains subject to scheduling and resource checks. Third-party payment setup and availability data access require verification. Changes that add new features must be evaluated for their effect on user stories, backlog, WBS, sprints, schedule, risks, budget, and RACI assignments before approval.
